<section class="text-size-3">
  <h2 class="text-size-heading-3" data-tags="practice" data-toc-exclude>
    Code with IA agents
  </h2>

  <app-exercise class="mt-400r">
    <p class="fragment">Let's prompt</p>
    <ul>
      <li class="fragment">Ask your favorite Coding Agent to generate a <code>AGENTS.md</code></li>
      <li class="fragment">Prompt to create a new test on adding a product to a wishlist</li>
    </ul>
  </app-exercise>

  <app-help class="fragment mt-800r">
    <p>Links</p>
    <ul>
      <li>https://playwright.dev/docs/test-agents</li>
    </ul>
  </app-help>

  <aside class="notes">
    <p>Example</p>
    <pre>
      create a new test named "Add product to wishlist", with these steps :
      - the user register
      - she navigates to a product page
      - she adds the product to her default wishlist
      - she goes to the user's wishlist in his account details
        -> the default wishlist should contain 1 product
      - she opens the default wishlist
        -> it contains the added product
      </pre>
  </aside>
</section>
